  "description": "Song Mok-A, the lead vocalist of Candy Wish, goes to the set of a drama being filmed by one of his bandmates to cheer them on. There, he runs into the lead actor, Kwon Seo-Do. However, the look Seo-Do gave Mok-A was nothing but sharp. \n\n*“Why is he glaring at me like that?”*\n\nBothered by Seo-Do’s gaze, Mok-A drinks too much at the drama’s wrap party, and when he comes to, he finds himself waking up in Seo-Do’s arms...\n\n *“Hyung, how far back do you remember from last night?”*\n\nW-what happened between us last night?!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
